  "description": "SharePoint document provider for OfficeAgent.NET, which lets AI agents edit existing Word, PowerPoint and Excel files and fill templates: creates, registers, opens, and saves documents in SharePoint document libraries through the Microsoft Graph REST endpoints. Agents address documents by an opaque (connectionId, documentId); the provider never exposes site URLs, drive ids, or credentials to the model.",
